      <div>
        <h3>Domain interpretation · open</h3>
        <p>This instrument has no domain author yet. Someone in geodesy or hydrogeology. The instrument measures how fast the ground is moving and which kelurahan move fastest. What is missing is the mechanism — how much is groundwater extraction against natural compaction and load, what the coastal defence programme assumes, and which measurements would settle it.</p>
        <p class="sm">Write the interpretation and take <b>first author</b>; the instrument's author above becomes <b>methods co-author</b> for the analysis and evaluation already built here.</p>
      </div>
